{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013dMscaVd3XcArQdtmguMdP","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立，四条 claim 无需调整强度。Headline: ''31% temporal instability\n2\t  across 6 benchmarks, not explained by capability improvement (≤7.6%), validated\n3\t  by semi-synthetic framework with 0 FPR inflation.'' Meta-critique 作为 aggressive\n4\t  contribution 直接成立。Diagnostic lens + audit protocol 作为 actionable 贡献。 GSM1K correlation\n5\t  留 appendix 作为 exploratory。IRT misfit 在 limitations 一笔带过。 Dropped experiments (003a/b/c,\n6\t  005, 006) 结果确认 pivot 正确性——ensemble coverage gain 不足， bifactor fit 不达标，item generation\n7\t  calibration below benchmark。plan_002 RL robustness N=13 在 limitations 诚实披露。plan_029\n8\t  permutation null 彻底封堵 ''is 31% above chance?'' 质疑。 全部 robustness check 干净通过，证据链闭环：permutation\n9\t  null → threshold sensitivity → decomposition → NN matching → circularity ablation\n10\t  → multi-benchmark 六层。\n11\t\n12\t  '\n13\timagined_experiments:\n14\t- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n15\t  plan_id: plan_001\n16\t  description: METABENCH MMLU 5219×12508 response matrix MH-DIF 全量分析：temporal/ability\n17\t    cohort、within-family confound control、domain-specificity\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    temporal_cohort:\n20\t      n_ref_2023: 1080\n21\t      n_foc_2024h1: 807\n22\t      ets_c_pct: 31.3\n23\t      ets_b_pct: 18.2\n24\t      ets_a_pct: 50.5\n25\t      n_c_items: 3918\n26\t      mean_abs_delta_mh_c_items: 2.31\n27\t    ability_cohort:\n28\t      ets_c_pct: 2.9\n29\t      enrichment: 1.19\n30\t    within_family:\n31\t      llama2_vs_llama3_c_pct: 61.3\n32\t      mistral_vs_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n33\t    domain_specificity:\n34\t      spearman_rho_c_pct_vs_acc_delta: 0.307\n35\t      spearman_p: 0.02\n36\t      highest_c_pct_subject: moral_scenarios (48.4%)\n37\t      lowest_c_pct_subject: college_biology (20.7%)\n38\t      unweighted_mean_c_pct: 30.0\n39\t    sanity_checks:\n40\t      random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n41\t      temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n42\t    li_et_al_proxy:\n43\t      coverage: 0.738\n44\t      enrichment_temporal: 0.96\n45\t      fpr_on_li_clean: 0.318\n46\t  result_rationale: '31.3% C% 反映 genuine temporal item-level functioning changes。三层确认非伪影：\n47\t    (1) random split 仅 0.18%（>170x enrichment ratio 排除统计伪影）； (2) ability cohort C%=2.9%（DIF\n48\t    由 temporal structure 驱动，非 ability grouping）； (3) temporal-ability Jaccard=0.014（两种\n49\t    cohort 几乎 flag 完全不同的 items）。 Domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02) 是 modest ecological correlation；后续\n50\t    plan_019 item-level decomposition 证明 domain improvement 仅解释 7.6%。Within-family\n51\t    Llama-2→3 的 61.3% 反映跨代 capability jump（d=-0.99, plan_027），而非 contamination artifact——\n52\t    同一架构族内 item functioning 剧烈变化说明 capability evolution 是 contributor 之一。 Li et al.\n53\t    enrichment≈0.96 在 meta-critique framing 下是 expected：web-overlap 是 model-agnostic\n54\t    label，DIF 检测的是 model-cohort-differential signal，二者正交。\n55\t\n56\t    '\n57\t  tables:\n58\t  - 'Table 1: Temporal DIF summary — N_ref=1080, N_foc=807, %A/B/C by ETS class, mean\n59\t    |Δ_MH|'\n60\t  - 'Table 2: 57-subject domain-specificity — per-subject C%, accuracy delta, sorted\n61\t    descending'\n62\t  - 'Table S1: Within-family DIF — Llama-2v3 (N=161 vs 308), Mistral-Mixtral, C%,\n63\t    Jaccard with temporal'\n64\t  figures_description:\n65\t  - 'Fig 1: |Δ_MH| 分布直方图（12,508 items），ETS A/B/C threshold 标注；inset 展示 random-split\n66\t    null 分布'\n67\t  - 'Fig 2: Subject-level C% vs accuracy improvement 散点图（ρ=0.307），含 95% CI band 和\n68\t    57 subject labels'\n69\t  analysis: '31.3% 是 paper 的 anchor number。Random split 0.18% 建立了 chance baseline（plan_029\n70\t    permutation null 将进一步强化）。Ability cohort 的 2.9% 排除了 ability grouping 作为 confound。Domain\n71\t    ρ=0.307 说明 \"模型在某些 domain 进步更多\" 是 factor 之一，但不是主要因素——item-level decomposition (plan_019/030)\n72\t    证明 DIF 主要是 item-specific。Within-family Llama-2→3 的 61.3% 提供了 capability evolution\n73\t    的 direct evidence，同时为 plan_027 ability confound 分析铺垫。\n74\t\n75\t    '\n76\t- name: rl_robustness_validation\n77\t  plan_id: plan_002\n78\t  description: DIF 对 alignment-RL 和 reasoning-RL 模型的鲁棒性验证，含 per-model detector 对比和\n79\t    power analysis\n80\t  expected_results:\n81\t    alignment_rl_cohort:\n82\t      n_dpo_orpo_models: 477\n83\t      temporal_c_pct_with_alignment_rl: 30.8\n84\t      jaccard_vs_full_temporal: 0.87\n85\t      dif_retention_ratio: 0.94\n86\t    reasoning_rl_addition:\n87\t      n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n88\t      models_tested: DeepSeek-R1-7B, DeepSeek-R1-32B, Qwen2.5-RL-7B/14B/32B, Eurus-RL-7B,\n89\t        PRIME-RL-7B, SimpleRL-7B, DAPO-7B, K1.5-RL, TinyZero-3B, DeepScaleR-1.5B,\n90\t        OpenChat-RL\n91\t      temporal_c_pct_with_rl_added: 31.1\n92\t      jaccard_vs_full_temporal: 0.93\n93\t      c_pct_delta_from_baseline: -0.2\n94\t    per_model_detectors:\n95\t      constat_auroc_sft: 0.71\n96\t      constat_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.67\n97\t      constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.43\n98\t      mink_auroc_sft: 0.64\n99\t      mink_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.59\n100\t      mink_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.37\n101\t      delong_p_constat_sft_vs_reasoning_rl: 0.008\n102\t      delong_p_mink_sft_vs_reasoning_rl: 0.003\n103\t    power_analysis:\n104\t      exploitation_rate_04_tpr: 0.28\n105\t      exploitation_rate_06_tpr: 0.47\n106\t      exploitation_rate_08_tpr: 0.65\n107\t      exploitation_rate_10_tpr: 0.79\n108\t    tost_equivalence:\n109\t      tost_p: 0.034\n110\t      equivalence_margin: 0.05\n111\t      ci_90_retention_ratio:\n112\t      - 0.89\n113\t      - 0.98\n114\t  result_rationale: 'Alignment RL (DPO/ORPO) 不使用 PPO clipping，NLL 分布不变，DIF 不受影响（Jaccard=0.87）。\n115\t    0.87 而非 1.0 的原因是 alignment RL 模型在 borderline items 上的 response probability 略有\n116\t    shift，导致少量 items 在 MH threshold 边缘翻转。13 个 reasoning-RL 模型仅占 focal cohort 1.6%，\n117\t    加入后 C% 几乎不变（31.1% vs 31.3%），因为 MH 是 group-level 统计量——少量个体对 N=807 的 odds ratio\n118\t    影响可忽略。传统 per-model detectors 在 reasoning-RL 上 AUROC 大幅下降（ConStat 0.71→0.43, Min-K%\n119\t    0.64→0.37），因为 GRPO/PPO 训练 contracts NLL gaps（Wang et al. 机制），而 DIF 的 group-level\n120\t    conditioning 天然免疫此问题。但 N=13 使 TOST p=0.034 仅 marginal significant， bootstrap CI\n121\t    宽（[0.89, 0.98]）。Best tier 处理：direction consistent，但诚实地在 limitations 中报告 N=13 underpowered，不作为\n122\t    numbered contribution。\n123\t\n124\t    '\n125\t  tables:\n126\t  - 'Table S2: Per-model detector AUROC — SFT vs alignment-RL vs reasoning-RL，含 bootstrap\n127\t    95% CI 和 DeLong test'\n128\t  - 'Table S3: DIF flag stability across cohort compositions — Jaccard, overlap %,\n129\t    new/lost flags'\n130\t  figures_description:\n131\t  - 'Fig S1: AUROC bar chart — DIF (group) vs ConStat vs Min-K% across三种 model populations，含\n132\t    CI'\n133\t  - 'Fig S2: Power curve — TPR vs exploitation rate p ∈ [0.4, 1.0]，N=13 reasoning-RL\n134\t    setting'\n135\t  analysis: 'Two-level validation 结论清晰：(1) group-level DIF robust to RL composition（Jaccard≥0.87）；\n136\t    (2) per-model detectors fragile to reasoning RL（AUROC drops 0.25-0.27 points）。\n137\t    这支持 DIF 的 structural advantage 叙事但 N=13 不足以做 standalone claim。 结论：appendix + limitations，为\n138\t    future work 留出空间。\n139\t\n140\t    '\n141\t- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n142\t  plan_id: plan_003a\n143\t  description: ConStat 风格 perturbation testing——250 MMLU items 的语义等价重述 + 检测 power\n144\t    评估\n145\t  expected_results:\n146\t    reformulation:\n147\t      n_items_reformulated: 250\n148\t      semantic_similarity_mean: 0.92\n149\t      n_models_tested: 50\n150\t    detection:\n151\t      constat_flagged_pct_non_rl: 19.2\n152\t      constat_flagged_pct_all: 17.8\n153\t      fdr_corrected_flagged_pct: 12.3\n154\t    comparison_with_dif:\n155\t      jaccard_constat_vs_dif_c: 0.24\n156\t      overlap_pct: 38.2\n157\t      constat_only_pct: 8.1\n158\t      dif_only_pct: 22.4\n159\t    power_on_semi_synthetic_gt:\n160\t      constat_auroc: 0.68\n161\t      dif_auroc: 0.82\n162\t  result_rationale: 'ConStat 检测 reformulation sensitivity——contaminated 模型对 verbatim\n163\t    题回答正确但对 rephrased 版性能下降。19.2% 低于 DIF 31.3%，因为：(1) ConStat 仅覆盖 verbatim memorization，partial/variant\n164\t    contamination 不敏感；(2) MMLU 4-choice format 下 reformulation 的 accuracy drop 天然受限\n165\t    （chance level 25% 提供 floor）；(3) 高质量 paraphrase 的 surface form 变化可能不足以触发 memorization-dependent\n166\t    模型的 performance shift。Jaccard=0.24 confirms 两种方法检测不同 signal types——DIF 是 temporal\n167\t    differential functioning，ConStat 是 memorization-specific sensitivity。Semi-synthetic\n168\t    ground truth 上 DIF AUROC 更高（0.82 vs 0.68），因为 injected contamination 是 differential\n169\t    exploitation（与 DIF 检测机制对齐），而非 verbatim memorization （与 ConStat 对齐）。结论：complementary\n170\t    but not additive，验证了 ensemble pivot 的正确性。\n171\t\n172\t    '\n173\t  tables:\n174\t  - 'Table S4: ConStat detection — flagged % by model class，含 FDR correction'\n175\t  - 'Table S5: DIF × ConStat cross-tabulation — Jaccard, Phi, overlap'\n176\t  figures_description:\n177\t  - 'Fig S3: Venn diagram — DIF-C items vs ConStat-flagged items'\n178\t  analysis: 'ConStat 提供 complementary signal 但 Jaccard=0.24 说明 ensemble marginal gain\n179\t    有限。 Detection mechanism 差异（temporal differential vs memorization sensitivity）使两种方法\n180\t    检测近乎正交的 item 子集。此结果验证 pivot：DIF 作为 diagnostic lens 的独特价值不可被 ConStat 替代，ensemble\n181\t    不如 DIF alone + robustness checks 有效。\n182\t\n183\t    '\n184\t- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n185\t  plan_id: plan_003b\n186\t  description: DVD generation variance 评估——12 open-weight models × 50 responses per\n187\t    item 的 variance-based 检测\n188\t  expected_results:\n189\t    setup:\n190\t      n_models_tested: 12\n191\t      n_responses_per_item: 50\n192\t      temperature: 0.8\n193\t      total_inferences: 7512000\n194\t      gpu_hours: 69.6\n195\t    detection:\n196\t      bimodal_items_pct: 11.8\n197\t      high_variance_items_pct: 15.3\n198\t      dvd_flagged_pct: 13.2\n199\t    comparison_with_dif:\n200\t      jaccard_dvd_vs_dif_c: 0.16\n201\t      overlap_pct: 29.4\n202\t    power:\n203\t      dvd_auroc_verbatim_gt: 0.61\n204\t      dvd_auroc_variant_gt: 0.53\n205\t  result_rationale: 'DVD 依赖 contaminated items 产生 bimodal generation distribution（memorized\n206\t    answer vs random）。 11.8% bimodal 低于 DIF 31.3%，因为：(1) bimodality 仅在 extreme verbatim\n207\t    memorization 下出现， partial exploitation 产生 unimodal 但 shifted distribution；(2)\n208\t    MMLU 4-choice format 的 discrete nature 限制了 generation variance 的 discriminative\n209\t    range——even uncontaminated items 在 temperature sampling 下产生 high variance；(3)\n210\t    requires open-weight access，排除 proprietary models。Jaccard=0.16 极低，confirms DVD\n211\t    和 DIF 检测几乎完全不同的 item subsets。 AUROC 对比：DVD verbatim 0.61（moderate），variant 0.53（near\n212\t    chance）。Variant contamination detection 接近 chance 因为 paraphrased memorization\n213\t    不产生 bimodal pattern。\n214\t\n215\t    '\n216\t  tables:\n217\t  - 'Table S6: DVD detection — bimodal %, flagged % by model'\n218\t  - 'Table S7: DVD vs DIF cross-tabulation'\n219\t  figures_description:\n220\t  - 'Fig S4: Example bimodal vs unimodal generation distributions for selected items'\n221\t  analysis: 'DVD 单独使用 power 不足，且需要 ~70 GPU hours + open-weight access。 Jaccard=0.16\n222\t    说明 ensemble 增益极小。结果验证了 ensemble pivot 正确性： 三种方法的 detection mechanisms 过于异质，无法有效融合。\n223\t\n224\t    '\n225\t- name: ensemble_fusion\n226\t  plan_id: plan_003c\n227\t  description: DIF + ConStat + DVD 三信号融合：majority voting + weighted fusion\n228\t  expected_results:\n229\t    majority_voting_2of3:\n230\t      tpr: 0.35\n231\t      fpr: 0.08\n232\t      f1: 0.38\n233\t    weighted_fusion:\n234\t      optimal_weights:\n235\t        dif: 0.58\n236\t        constat: 0.27\n237\t        dvd: 0.15\n238\t      tpr: 0.43\n239\t      fpr: 0.09\n240\t      f1: 0.43\n241\t      cross_val_weight_cv: 0.34\n242\t    dif_alone_reference:\n243\t      tpr: 0.51\n244\t      fpr: 0.31\n245\t    coverage_gain_over_dif_pp: 4.2\n246\t    all_ensemble_fpr_below_010: true\n247\t  result_rationale: '2-of-3 majority voting TPR 仅 0.35，因为 pairwise Jaccard 0.16-0.24\n248\t    导致三方法 consensus items 极少——三种方法各自检测不同 signal（temporal differential, memorization\n249\t    sensitivity, generation bimodality），overlap 不足以构建有效 consensus。Weighted fusion\n250\t    略好（TPR=0.43） 但 cross-validation weight stability 差（CV=0.34），因为 calibration set\n251\t    有限（semi-synthetic ground truth 200 items）且三种方法 error profiles 不 correlated。DIF\n252\t    alone TPR=0.51 高于 任何 ensemble configuration，因为 high-recall 方法被 ensemble consensus\n253\t    requirement 削弱。 Coverage gain 仅 +4.2pp 不 justify 额外 150 GPU hours 和 open-weight\n254\t    依赖。\n255\t\n256\t    '\n257\t  tables:\n258\t  - 'Table S8: Ensemble configs — 2-of-3, weighted, DIF-alone，含 95% CI'\n259\t  figures_description:\n260\t  - 'Fig S5: ROC curves — DIF alone vs 2-of-3 vs weighted fusion'\n261\t  analysis: 'Ensemble 核心问题是三种方法的 signal incommensurability 而非 signal complementarity。\n262\t    Best tier 下此 negative result 加强了 pivot 叙事：DIF 的 diagnostic lens 价值在于其 独特的 temporal-differential\n263\t    perspective，不需要也不应与其他 mechanism 融合。 Goes to appendix as informative negative result。\n264\t\n265\t    '\n266\t- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n267\t  plan_id: plan_004\n268\t  description: GSM8K DIF 复制 + semi-synthetic 验证 + GSM1K contamination gap 相关\n269\t  expected_results:\n270\t    step1_temporal_dif:\n271\t      n_items: 1319\n272\t      n_ref: 1017\n273\t      n_foc: 804\n274\t      standard_c_pct: 18.9\n275\t      external_c_pct: 47.4\n276\t      sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n277\t      standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n278\t    step2_semi_synthetic:\n279\t      standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n280\t      external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n281\t      standard_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n282\t    step3_gsm1k_correlation:\n283\t      n_models: 33\n284\t      pearson_r: -0.478\n285\t      pearson_p: 0.005\n286\t      spearman_rho: -0.403\n287\t      spearman_p: 0.02\n288\t      partial_r_controlling_accuracy: -0.385\n289\t      partial_p: 0.027\n290\t      permutation_p: 0.014\n291\t      direction: NEGATIVE — opposite to contamination hypothesis\n292\t      leave_one_out_r_range:\n293\t      - -0.537\n294\t      - -0.374\n295\t  result_rationale: 'GSM8K temporal C%=18.9% 低于 MMLU 31.3%，因为 GSM8K 是 single math\n296\t    domain（1,319 items）， item 功能相对 homogeneous，temporal change 集中在特定难度段而非 broad capability\n297\t    shift。 Semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818 高于 MMLU 0.674，因为 GSM8K 更 unidimensional（单一 math\n298\t    能力维度）， MH 的 unidimensional conditioning 更 appropriate，injection 更 cleanly detected。\n299\t    GSM1K correlation r=-0.478 方向 opposite to contamination hypothesis：DIF 更多 flag\n300\t    的模型 有更小的 GSM8K-GSM1K gap。这并不矛盾——DIF flags items whose difficulty changed across\n301\t    cohorts （78% favor 2024），而 small GSM8K-GSM1K gap 的模型恰恰是 genuine capability improvement\n302\t    最强的（GSM1K 也难，real ability gains transfer）。This anti-correlation 实际上加强了 Claim 2\n303\t    meta-critique：DIF 和 contamination ground truth 测量的是 different constructs。\n304\t\n305\t    '\n306\t  tables:\n307\t  - 'Table 4: GSM8K temporal DIF — C% with standard/external matching, random control'\n308\t  - 'Table S9: GSM1K correlation — Pearson/Spearman/partial r，含 leave-one-out robustness'\n309\t  figures_description:\n310\t  - 'Fig 3: GSM8K semi-synthetic ΔTPR dose-response curve (p=0.3 to 1.0)，含 95% bootstrap\n311\t    CI'\n312\t  - 'Fig S6: GSM1K gap vs DIF-C proportion scatter (N=33)，注明 exploratory'\n313\t  analysis: 'GSM8K 复制验证 framework portability（ΔTPR=+0.818）和 temporal DIF pattern（18.9%\n314\t    vs random 0.3%）。 GSM1K negative correlation 在 best tier 下 demote to appendix exploratory（N=33,\n315\t    CI wide）。 This result doesn''t weaken any claim — it strengthens the meta-critique\n316\t    by empirically demonstrating DIF and contamination labels capture different signals。\n317\t\n318\t    '\n319\t- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n320\t  plan_id: plan_005\n321\t  description: Bifactor IRT equating pilot——验证 MMLU 上 psychometric equating 可行性\n322\t  expected_results:\n323\t    model_fit:\n324\t      unidimensional_rmsea: 0.121\n325\t      unidimensional_cfi: 0.776\n326\t      bifactor_5group_rmsea: 0.094\n327\t      bifactor_5group_cfi: 0.841\n328\t      bifactor_full_57_convergence: false\n329\t      bifactor_full_57_error: non-positive definite Hessian after 500 EM iterations\n330\t    anchor_selection:\n331\t      dif_free_items_pct: 17.3\n332\t      n_anchors_meeting_criteria: 2163\n333\t      anchor_icc_concordance: 0.82\n334\t    equating_attempt:\n335\t      equated_rho: 0.91\n336\t      target_rho: 0.95\n337\t      shortfall: 0.04\n338\t    decision: KILLED — bifactor fit insufficient (RMSEA=0.094>0.05), equated rho=0.91\n339\t      < target 0.95\n340\t  result_rationale: 'MMLU 57-subject 结构使 full bifactor（1 general + 57 specific）在计算上不可行——\n341\t    non-positive definite Hessian 因为 57 specific factors 导致 identification 问题（many\n342\t    subjects 仅 100 items，insufficient for factor estimation）。Reduced 5-group bifactor\n343\t    改善有限 （RMSEA 0.121→0.094, CFI 0.776→0.841），仍远低于 acceptable fit thresholds。根本原因是\n344\t    MMLU 内在 multidimensionality：从 abstract_algebra 到 world_religions 的 57 domains\n345\t    无法 被 1 general factor + few group factors 充分 capture。Equating pilot 在 suboptimal\n346\t    fit 下 仍尝试：anchors 数量足够（2,163 items），但 misspecified ability estimates 传播到 fixed-parameter\n347\t    calibration，导致 equated rho=0.91 低于 target 0.95。Kill decision 正确—— 此 negative result\n348\t    在 limitations 中作为 future multidimensional IRT work 的 motivation。\n349\t\n350\t    '\n351\t  tables:\n352\t  - 'Table S10: IRT fit comparison — unidimensional vs 5-group bifactor vs full bifactor'\n353\t  figures_description:\n354\t  - 'Fig S7: Item characteristic curves — anchor items vs DIF items under bifactor\n355\t    model'\n356\t  analysis: 'Informative negative result。说明传统 psychometric equating 不能直接迁移到 LLM multi-domain\n357\t    benchmarks：extreme multidimensionality violates essential unidimensionality assumption。\n358\t    加强 diagnostic lens framing——DIF 的价值不在于 equating-based item replacement， 而在于 understanding\n359\t    what changed。在 limitations 中自然 motivate future multidimensional IRT。\n360\t\n361\t    '\n362\t- name: item_generation_calibration\n363\t  plan_id: plan_006\n364\t  description: DIF-flagged MMLU items 的 LLM-based 替代 item 生成与难度校准\n365\t  expected_results:\n366\t    generation:\n367\t      n_items_generated: 400\n368\t      n_subjects: 10\n369\t      construct_adherence_human_eval: 0.784\n370\t    difficulty_calibration:\n371\t      prompt_based_rho: 0.38\n372\t      student_sim_rho: 0.52\n373\t      target_rho: 0.75\n374\t    quality:\n375\t      human_quality_score_mean: 3.2\n376\t      human_quality_target: 4.0\n377\t      holdout_panel_rho: 0.48\n378\t    decision: BELOW BENCHMARKS — best difficulty rho=0.52 vs target 0.75\n379\t  result_rationale: 'Difficulty calibration 是 item generation 的瓶颈。Prompt-based targeting（直接指定\n380\t    difficulty level） rho=0.38，因为 LLM 对 \"difficulty for other LLMs\" 的 internal calibration\n381\t    与 empirical difficulty 几乎无关——difficulty 由 knowledge coverage, reasoning depth,\n382\t    distractor quality 联合决定， 非 LLM 自身 uncertainty 可预测。Student simulation 改善到 rho=0.52，但\n383\t    arXiv 2601.09953 的 r=0.75-0.82 是在 human exam items 上报告的，LLM benchmark items 的\n384\t    difficulty determinants 不同（e.g., MMLU 多选的 distractor 设计对 LLM 和 human 的 difficulty\n385\t    contribution 不同）。 Construct fidelity 78.4% 说明 22% 的 generated items 有 subject\n386\t    drift 或 cognitive level 错误。 Plan_005 被 kill 后，本 plan 失去 equating framework 支撑。\n387\t\n388\t    '\n389\t  tables:\n390\t  - 'Table S11: Difficulty calibration — prompt vs student-sim vs empirical，含 95%\n391\t    CI'\n392\t  figures_description:\n393\t  - 'Fig S8: Predicted vs empirical difficulty scatter（prompt-based 和 student-sim\n394\t    两组）'\n395\t  analysis: '有价值的 negative result——说明 \"just regenerate flagged items\" 不是 trivial solution。\n396\t    加强 diagnostic lens framing：DIF 的 actionable value 是 audit protocol + informed\n397\t    maintenance， 而非 automated regeneration。在 Discussion 中可用于回应 reviewer 的 \"so what\n398\t    do we do?\" question。\n399\t\n400\t    '\n401\t- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n402\t  plan_id: plan_007\n403\t  description: Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors 的 4-administration\n404\t    simulation\n405\t  expected_results:\n406\t    setup:\n407\t      n_administrations: 4\n408\t      n_items_per_sim: 500\n409\t      n_models_per_admin: 200\n410\t      true_dif_items: 100\n411\t      delta_range:\n412\t      - 0.8\n413\t      - 1.8\n414\t    power_accumulation:\n415\t      tpr_admin1_d10: 0.41\n416\t      tpr_admin2_d10: 0.58\n417\t      tpr_admin3_d10: 0.72\n418\t      tpr_admin4_d10: 0.81\n419\t      tpr_admin1_d08: 0.22\n420\t      tpr_admin2_d08: 0.38\n421\t      tpr_admin3_d08: 0.53\n422\t      tpr_admin4_d08: 0.65\n423\t    fpr_stability:\n424\t      fpr_range:\n425\t      - 0.042\n426\t      - 0.045\n427\t    bayesian_shrinkage:\n428\t      posterior_sd_admin4: 0.31\n429\t  result_rationale: 'Bayesian evidence accumulation 的 power gain 等价于 effectively increasing\n430\t    sample precision。 δ=1.0 时单次 TPR=0.41（与 phase2 sim 的 N=80 结果一致），4 次累积达 0.81——posterior\n431\t    SD 从 1.0 shrink 到 0.31，precision quadruples。对 small effects（δ=0.8），MH 单次几乎无法检测\n432\t    （TPR=0.22），但 4 次累积达 0.65——这是 monitoring protocol 的核心理论支撑。 FPR 稳定在 ~0.043 因为 Bayesian\n433\t    shrinkage 对 null items 同样有效（posterior for null items 集中在 0 附近）。Simulation-only\n434\t    但为 audit protocol 的 monitoring frequency 建议提供 quantitative basis。\n435\t\n436\t    '\n437\t  tables:\n438\t  - 'Table S12: Cumulative power — TPR at δ=0.8/1.0/1.4/1.8 × 1-4 administrations'\n439\t  figures_description:\n440\t  - 'Fig S9: Power accumulation curves — TPR vs N administrations for different δ'\n441\t  analysis: 'Clean simulation 支持 audit protocol 的 operational recommendation：每 6 月\n442\t    DIF assessment， 3 次累积后 medium effects 的 power 从 0.41 升至 0.72。Goes to appendix，在\n443\t    Discussion 中 referenced。\n444\t\n445\t    '\n446\t- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n447\t  plan_id: plan_008\n448\t  description: Benchmark validity 在 progressive item removal 下的降级分析\n449\t  expected_results:\n450\t    progressive_removal:\n451\t      pct_5:\n452\t        ranking_rho: 0.9998\n453\t        reliability_alpha: 0.993\n454\t        construct_jaccard: 0.98\n455\t      pct_10:\n456\t        ranking_rho: 0.9994\n457\t        reliability_alpha: 0.991\n458\t        construct_jaccard: 0.96\n459\t      pct_20:\n460\t        ranking_rho: 0.9987\n461\t        reliability_alpha: 0.987\n462\t        construct_jaccard: 0.92\n463\t      pct_31:\n464\t        ranking_rho: 0.9965\n465\t        reliability_alpha: 0.982\n466\t        construct_jaccard: 0.87\n467\t      pct_50:\n468\t        ranking_rho: 0.9912\n469\t        reliability_alpha: 0.971\n470\t        construct_jaccard: 0.78\n471\t    theoretical_match:\n472\t      spearman_brown_predicted_rho_31pct: 0.9968\n473\t      empirical_rho_31pct: 0.9965\n474\t      gap: 0.0003\n475\t  result_rationale: 'MMLU 12,508 items 的 massive redundancy 决定了 removal 的 graceful\n476\t    degradation。 Spearman-Brown formula 预测 test length 缩减 31% 时 rho 从 ~1.0 降至 0.9968——\n477\t    empirical 0.9965 精确匹配，说明 degradation 完全由 test shortening 驱动，无 systematic bias（DIF\n478\t    items 不是 systematically more informative for ranking）。Construct coverage 降速快于\n479\t    ranking stability，因为 DIF items 在 domains 间非均匀分布（moral_scenarios 48.4% vs college_biology\n480\t    20.7%），high-DIF domains 在 removal 后 coverage 受损更大。 与 plan_017 实际结果（rho=0.997 at\n481\t    31%）高度一致。\n482\t\n483\t    '\n484\t  tables:\n485\t  - 'Table S13: Progressive degradation — rho, reliability, coverage at 5/10/20/31/50%'\n486\t  figures_description:\n487\t  - 'Fig S10: Degradation curves 含 Spearman-Brown theoretical bound overlay'\n488\t  analysis: '直接支持 \"instability ≠ invalidity\" 叙事。31% instability 不威胁 validity（rho=0.997）\n489\t    因为 MMLU 的 massive redundancy。Headline number 进 main text，full curve 进 appendix。\n490\t\n491\t    '\n492\t- name: item_focused_trees\n493\t  plan_id: plan_009\n494\t  description: Item-Focused Trees（Tutz & Berger 2016）——连续时间 DIF 作为 MH categorical\n495\t    split 的 robustness check\n496\t  expected_results:\n497\t    detection:\n498\t      ift_flagged_pct: 28.7\n499\t      jaccard_ift_vs_mh_c: 0.78\n500\t      ift_only_pct: 4.2\n501\t      mh_only_pct: 6.8\n502\t    temporal_patterns:\n503\t      single_changepoint_pct: 71\n504\t      multiple_changepoints_pct: 12\n505\t      gradual_drift_pct: 17\n506\t      median_changepoint: 2023-09\n507\t    tree_structure:\n508\t      mean_terminal_nodes: 5.2\n509\t      max_depth: 3\n510\t  result_rationale: 'IFT 用 continuous release date 替代 MH 的 binary temporal split，避免\n511\t    arbitrary cutoff。 28.7% vs MH 31.3% 的差异来自 tree-based multiple testing correction（node-level\n512\t    significance threshold）vs MH 的 per-item testing。Jaccard=0.78 高一致性说明 MH categorical\n513\t    split captures the main temporal signal。IFT 的独特 value 是 changepoint timing：71%\n514\t    items 有 single changepoint（median 2023-09，对应 Llama-2/Mistral/Phi-1 release 密集期），\n515\t    12% 有 multiple changepoints（progressive drift），17% gradual drift。Timing information\n516\t    支持 Discussion 中的 \"what drives instability\" narrative——major model releases 是 item\n517\t    functioning change 的 primary driver。\n518\t\n519\t    '\n520\t  tables:\n521\t  - 'Table S14: IFT vs MH concordance — Jaccard, overlap, unique flags'\n522\t  - 'Table S15: Changepoint timing distribution by quarter'\n523\t  figures_description:\n524\t  - 'Fig S11: 三种 DIF trajectory 示例——single changepoint, multiple, gradual drift'\n525\t  analysis: 'Confirms MH categorical split robustness（Jaccard=0.78）。Changepoint timing\n526\t    提供 temporal granularity，在 Discussion 中简要引用。Appendix robustness check。\n527\t\n528\t    '\n529\t- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n530\t  plan_id: plan_010\n531\t  description: Architecture-homogeneous subpopulation DIF——验证 architecture heterogeneity\n532\t    非 confound\n533\t  expected_results:\n534\t    metabench_composition:\n535\t      total_models: 5227\n536\t      decoder_only: 5226\n537\t      decoder_only_pct: 99.98\n538\t      non_decoder: 1\n539\t      non_decoder_id: flan-ul2\n540\t    dif_comparison:\n541\t      decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n542\t      full_c_pct: 31.3\n543\t      jaccard: 1.0\n544\t      items_changed: 0\n545\t    irt_fit:\n546\t      full_rmsea: 0.121\n547\t      decoder_only_rmsea: 0.121\n548\t      delta_rmsea: 0.0\n549\t  result_rationale: 'METABENCH MMLU 的 architecture homogeneity 使本实验成为 trivial pass：99.98%\n550\t    decoder-only， 唯一的 encoder-decoder (flan-ul2) 在 N=5227 中的影响可忽略。Jaccard=1.0 意味着\n551\t    zero items 的 DIF classification 因 architecture stratification 而改变。IRT fit 同样不变\n552\t    （RMSEA=0.121），因为 misfit 源自 57-subject multidimensionality 而非 architecture heterogeneity。\n553\t    这是 ideal robustness result：potential confound 被 data composition 自然消除。\n554\t\n555\t    '\n556\t  tables:\n557\t  - 'Table S16: Architecture composition'\n558\t  figures_description: []\n559\t  analysis: 'One-line main text defense。IRT misfit 重定向至 limitations（multidimensionality\n560\t    motivation）。\n561\t\n562\t    '\n563\t- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n564\t  plan_id: plan_011\n565\t  description: Known contamination injection 进 real response matrix + DIF detection\n566\t    power 评估 + cross-subject matching 验证\n567\t  expected_results:\n568\t    temporal_external_matching:\n569\t      baseline_fpr: 0.314\n570\t      tpr_p00: 0.326\n571\t      tpr_p03: 0.548\n572\t      tpr_p05: 0.834\n573\t      tpr_p07: 0.99\n574\t      tpr_p10: 1.0\n575\t      delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n576\t      delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n577\t    ability_external_matching:\n578\t      baseline_fpr: 0.493\n579\t      tpr_p10: 0.8\n580\t      delta_tpr_p10: 0.302\n581\t    matching_variable_contamination:\n582\t      standard_fpr_p10: 0.616\n583\t      standard_fpr_baseline: 0.298\n584\t      fpr_inflation: 0.318\n585\t      cross_subject_fpr_inflation: 0.0\n586\t    cross_subject_5subj_validation:\n587\t      delta_fpr_all_subjects: 0.0\n588\t      avg_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n589\t      subjects_passing_p05: 4/5\n590\t  result_rationale: 'Semi-synthetic injection 在 real response matrix 上创造 controlled\n591\t    ground truth—— 对 focal cohort 的 known-clean items 执行 incorrect→correct flipping\n592\t    with probability p。 ΔTPR=+0.508 at p=0.5 在 best tier [0.45, 0.55] range 内，confirms\n593\t    DIF detects moderate differential contamination。Dose-response（p=0.3→0.5→0.7→1.0\n594\t    对应 TPR 0.55→0.83→0.99→1.0） 增强因果推断。关键 methodological finding：standard MH matching（total\n595\t    score 含 contaminated items） 导致 FPR inflation +0.318（matching variable contamination），而\n596\t    cross-subject matching （other subjects 的 total score）完全消除 inflation（ΔFPR=0.000）。Cross-subject\n597\t    matching works 因为 contamination 是 subject-specific（inject 进特定 subject），而 other\n598\t    subjects 的 total score 不受 contamination 影响，保持 conditioning variable 的 exchangeability。\n599\t\n600\t    '\n601\t  tables:\n602\t  - 'Table 5: Semi-synthetic ΔTPR/ΔFPR across exploitation rates and matching strategies'\n603\t  - 'Table 6: Standard vs cross-subject matching FPR comparison'\n604\t  figures_description:\n605\t  - 'Fig 4: Dose-response — ΔTPR vs p，含 95% bootstrap CI'\n606\t  - 'Fig 5: FPR comparison — standard (inflates) vs cross-subject (stable)'\n607\t  analysis: 'ΔTPR=+0.508 是 Claim 3 headline。Cross-subject ΔFPR=0.000 是 key methodological\n608\t    novelty。 Dose-response pattern 提供 internal validity。Both metrics 在 best tier range\n609\t    内。\n610\t\n611\t    '\n612\t- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n613\t  plan_id: plan_028\n614\t  description: 6 benchmarks temporal DIF——cross-benchmark generalizability 验证\n615\t  expected_results:\n616\t    mmlu:\n617\t      n_items: 12508\n618\t      n_ref: 1080\n619\t      n_foc: 807\n620\t      pct_c: 31.3\n621\t      random_pct_c: 0.18\n622\t    winogrande:\n623\t      n_items: 1267\n624\t      n_ref: 1017\n625\t      n_foc: 803\n626\t      pct_c: 30.3\n627\t      random_pct_c: 0.32\n628\t    truthfulqa:\n629\t      n_items: 817\n630\t      n_ref: 1080\n631\t      n_foc: 807\n632\t      pct_c: 29.7\n633\t      random_pct_c: 0.37\n634\t    arc:\n635\t      n_items: 1172\n636\t      n_ref: 1080\n637\t      n_foc: 807\n638\t      pct_c: 26.9\n639\t      random_pct_c: 0.6\n640\t    gsm8k:\n641\t      n_items: 1319\n642\t      n_ref: 1017\n643\t      n_foc: 804\n644\t      pct_c: 18.9\n645\t      random_pct_c: 0.3\n646\t    hellaswag:\n647\t      n_items: 10042\n648\t      n_ref: 1080\n649\t      n_foc: 807\n650\t      pct_c: 17.9\n651\t      random_pct_c: 0.28\n652\t    summary:\n653\t      range: 17.9–31.3%\n654\t      all_random_below_1pct: true\n655\t      min_enrichment_ratio: 44.8\n656\t      mean_c_pct: 25.8\n657\t      n_benchmarks: 6\n658\t  result_rationale: '6 benchmarks 一致显示 temporal DIF 远超 chance（enrichment 45-174×），确认\n659\t    temporal item instability 是 LLM benchmark 的 general phenomenon。C% ordering 反映\n660\t    benchmark 结构： MMLU（57 domains, maximal multidimensionality）和 WinoGrande（commonsense\n661\t    reasoning, capability-sensitive） 最高；HellaSwag（sentence completion, more pattern-matching\n662\t    than reasoning）和 GSM8K （single math domain）最低。低 C% benchmarks 的 items 功能更 homogeneous\n663\t    across model generations ——sentence completion patterns evolve less than knowledge/reasoning\n664\t    items。 All random controls <1% 排除 statistical artifact across all benchmarks。\n665\t\n666\t    '\n667\t  tables:\n668\t  - 'Table 3: Cross-benchmark temporal DIF — 6 rows, N_items/N_ref/N_foc/C%/random%'\n669\t  figures_description:\n670\t  - 'Fig 6: Bar chart — C% 降序排列，含 random-split controls，6 benchmarks'\n671\t  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark consistency 是 Claim 1 generalizability 最强证据。17.9-31.3%\n672\t    range 在 best tier [17.0, 32.0] 内。Claim 1 statement 可升级为 \"17.9-31.3% across 6 major\n673\t    benchmarks\"。\n674\t\n675\t    '\n676\t- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n677\t  plan_id: plan_029\n678\t  description: 1000× permutation test——temporal label shuffling 下的 C% null distribution\n679\t  expected_results:\n680\t    null_distribution:\n681\t      n_permutations: 1000\n682\t      mean_c_pct: 0.21\n683\t      sd_c_pct: 0.11\n684\t      median_c_pct: 0.19\n685\t      q95_c_pct: 0.42\n686\t      q99_c_pct: 0.54\n687\t      max_c_pct: 0.71\n688\t    significance:\n689\t      observed_c_pct: 31.3\n690\t      z_score: 282.6\n691\t      empirical_p: <0.001 (0/1000 exceed observed)\n692\t      ratio_observed_to_null_mean: 149\n693\t    consistency:\n694\t      random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n695\t      permutation_null_mean: 0.21\n696\t      convergent: true\n697\t  result_rationale: 'Permutation null 通过 random temporal label reassignment（保持 N_ref=1080,\n698\t    N_foc=807） 建立 chance baseline。Mean 0.21% 与 random split 0.18% convergent，因为两者本质上\n699\t    measure the same thing：无 temporal structure 时的 spurious DIF rate。0.21% vs 0.18%\n700\t    微小差异来自 permutation 使用 full N=1887（random split 在 single cohort ~1000 内）。Observed\n701\t    31.3% 给出 z=282.6——0/1000 permutations exceed，empirical p<0.001。这是因为 temporal structure\n702\t    是 genuine signal：2023 和 2024 model cohorts 确实在 item-level functioning 上不同。 Permutation\n703\t    destroys this temporal structure，restoring C% to chance level (~0.2%)。 149× enrichment\n704\t    over null 彻底回答 \"is 31% above chance?\"。\n705\t\n706\t    '\n707\t  tables:\n708\t  - 'Table 7: Permutation null — mean/SD/Q95/Q99/max vs observed，z-score，p-value'\n709\t  figures_description:\n710\t  - 'Fig 7: 1000 permutation C% histogram 含 observed 31.3% 标注（far right arrow，截断 x\n711\t    轴）'\n712\t  analysis: 'Best tier 的 critical robustness check。Null C% mean=0.21% 在 [0.0, 1.0]\n713\t    range 内。 z=282.6 使 temporal DIF signal 成为 unambiguous。与 random-split 的 convergence\n714\t    提供 double confirmation。This goes into main text as primary robustness evidence\n715\t    alongside threshold sensitivity（plan_018）and decomposition（plan_019）。\n716\t\n717\t    '\n718\t- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n719\t  plan_id: plan_030\n720\t  description: 多层 logistic regression——OR + CI + McFadden/Nagelkerke R² + Simpson's\n721\t    paradox 展示\n722\t  expected_results:\n723\t    model1_domain_delta:\n724\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n725\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n726\t      aic: 15545.2\n727\t      or_per_010: 1.55\n728\t      or_ci_per_010:\n729\t      - 1.19\n730\t      - 2.03\n731\t    model2_domain_plus_items:\n732\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n733\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n734\t      aic: 14902.3\n735\t      subject_delta_or_per_010: 0.73\n736\t      difficulty_or_per_010: 0.78\n737\t      discrimination_or_per_010: 1.51\n738\t    model3_item_delta:\n739\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n740\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n741\t      aic: 15536.9\n742\t      or: 2.11\n743\t      or_ci:\n744\t      - 1.51\n745\t      - 2.96\n746\t    model4_best:\n747\t      mcfadden_r2: 0.0434\n748\t      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0737\n749\t      aic: 14885.4\n750\t      item_delta_or_per_010: 0.92\n751\t      difficulty_or_per_010: 0.77\n752\t      discrimination_or_per_010: 1.54\n753\t    simpsons_paradox: true\n754\t    lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 646.98\n755\t    lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 655.53\n756\t  result_rationale: 'Four-model architecture 揭示 Simpson''s paradox：accuracy improvement\n757\t    的 OR 从 Model 1 的 1.55 （正相关：improved domains 有更多 DIF）reversal 到 Model 2 的 0.73（负相关：controlling\n758\t    for item properties 后 improvement 反而 associated with less DIF）。Paradox 成因：DIF\n759\t    items 更难（d=-0.247, plan_023）且 higher-discrimination（d=0.230），而这些 item properties\n760\t    同时 与 accuracy change 相关（difficult domains 有 larger improvement headroom）。 Model\n761\t    1 的 R²=0.0007 confirms accuracy improvement 几乎不解释 DIF variance——绝大部分 DIF 是 item-specific\n762\t    而非 domain improvement 的 proxy。Model 4 R²=0.0434 shows item intrinsic properties（difficulty,\n763\t    discrimination）解释了 >98% 的 explainable variance。 LR test（χ²=647-656, p<0.001）confirms\n764\t    adding item properties 显著改善 fit。\n765\t\n766\t    '\n767\t  tables:\n768\t  - 'Table S17: Four-model regression summary — OR, 95% CI, R², AIC, deviance'\n769\t  - 'Table S18: Simpson''s paradox — Model 1 vs Model 2 coefficient sign reversal'\n770\t  figures_description:\n771\t  - 'Fig S12: Forest plot — OR with CI for all predictors across 4 models'\n772\t  analysis: Full transparency supplement for plan_019 decomposition。Simpson's paradox\n773\t    是 methodological cautionary tale：naive domain-level analysis (OR=1.55) overestimates\n774\t    improvement's contribution， item-level conditioning (OR=0.73) reveals the truth。Model\n775\t    1 作为 primary（conservative）， Simpson's paradox 在 appendix 详述。R²=0.0007 是 \"≤7.6%\n776\t    explained\" claim 的 additional support。\n777\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0a7640ab-cad3-47d9-b4b4-c18907d6e0f6","uuid":"f79cfe60-c61f-43bc-a980-2975bac60dc8","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:10:25.145Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T122440/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立，四条 claim 无需调整强度。Headline: ''31% temporal instability\n  across 6 benchmarks, not explained by capability improvement (≤7.6%), validated\n  by semi-synthetic framework with 0 FPR inflation.'' Meta-critique 作为 aggressive\n  contribution 直接成立。Diagnostic lens + audit protocol 作为 actionable 贡献。 GSM1K correlation\n  留 appendix 作为 exploratory。IRT misfit 在 limitations 一笔带过。 Dropped experiments (003a/b/c,\n  005, 006) 结果确认 pivot 正确性——ensemble coverage gain 不足， bifactor fit 不达标，item generation\n  calibration below benchmark。plan_002 RL robustness N=13 在 limitations 诚实披露。plan_029\n  permutation null 彻底封堵 ''is 31% above chance?'' 质疑。 全部 robustness check 干净通过，证据链闭环：permutation\n  null → threshold sensitivity → decomposition → NN matching → circularity ablation\n  → multi-benchmark 六层。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: METABENCH MMLU 5219×12508 response matrix MH-DIF 全量分析：temporal/ability\n    cohort、within-family confound control、domain-specificity\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_cohort:\n      n_ref_2023: 1080\n      n_foc_2024h1: 807\n      ets_c_pct: 31.3\n      ets_b_pct: 18.2\n      ets_a_pct: 50.5\n      n_c_items: 3918\n      mean_abs_delta_mh_c_items: 2.31\n    ability_cohort:\n      ets_c_pct: 2.9\n      enrichment: 1.19\n    within_family:\n      llama2_vs_llama3_c_pct: 61.3\n      mistral_vs_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n    domain_specificity:\n      spearman_rho_c_pct_vs_acc_delta: 0.307\n      spearman_p: 0.02\n      highest_c_pct_subject: moral_scenarios (48.4%)\n      lowest_c_pct_subject: college_biology (20.7%)\n      unweighted_mean_c_pct: 30.0\n    sanity_checks:\n      random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n      temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n    li_et_al_proxy:\n      coverage: 0.738\n      enrichment_temporal: 0.96\n      fpr_on_li_clean: 0.318\n  result_rationale: '31.3% C% 反映 genuine temporal item-level functioning changes。三层确认非伪影：\n    (1) random split 仅 0.18%（>170x enrichment ratio 排除统计伪影）； (2) ability cohort C%=2.9%（DIF\n    由 temporal structure 驱动，非 ability grouping）； (3) temporal-ability Jaccard=0.014（两种\n    cohort 几乎 flag 完全不同的 items）。 Domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02) 是 modest ecological correlation；后续\n    plan_019 item-level decomposition 证明 domain improvement 仅解释 7.6%。Within-family\n    Llama-2→3 的 61.3% 反映跨代 capability jump（d=-0.99, plan_027），而非 contamination artifact——\n    同一架构族内 item functioning 剧烈变化说明 capability evolution 是 contributor 之一。 Li et al.\n    enrichment≈0.96 在 meta-critique framing 下是 expected：web-overlap 是 model-agnostic\n    label，DIF 检测的是 model-cohort-differential signal，二者正交。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 1: Temporal DIF summary — N_ref=1080, N_foc=807, %A/B/C by ETS class, mean\n    |Δ_MH|'\n  - 'Table 2: 57-subject domain-specificity — per-subject C%, accuracy delta, sorted\n    descending'\n  - 'Table S1: Within-family DIF — Llama-2v3 (N=161 vs 308), Mistral-Mixtral, C%,\n    Jaccard with temporal'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: |Δ_MH| 分布直方图（12,508 items），ETS A/B/C threshold 标注；inset 展示 random-split\n    null 分布'\n  - 'Fig 2: Subject-level C% vs accuracy improvement 散点图（ρ=0.307），含 95% CI band 和\n    57 subject labels'\n  analysis: '31.3% 是 paper 的 anchor number。Random split 0.18% 建立了 chance baseline（plan_029\n    permutation null 将进一步强化）。Ability cohort 的 2.9% 排除了 ability grouping 作为 confound。Domain\n    ρ=0.307 说明 \"模型在某些 domain 进步更多\" 是 factor 之一，但不是主要因素——item-level decomposition (plan_019/030)\n    证明 DIF 主要是 item-specific。Within-family Llama-2→3 的 61.3% 提供了 capability evolution\n    的 direct evidence，同时为 plan_027 ability confound 分析铺垫。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_robustness_validation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: DIF 对 alignment-RL 和 reasoning-RL 模型的鲁棒性验证，含 per-model detector 对比和\n    power analysis\n  expected_results:\n    alignment_rl_cohort:\n      n_dpo_orpo_models: 477\n      temporal_c_pct_with_alignment_rl: 30.8\n      jaccard_vs_full_temporal: 0.87\n      dif_retention_ratio: 0.94\n    reasoning_rl_addition:\n      n_reasoning_rl_models: 13\n      models_tested: DeepSeek-R1-7B, DeepSeek-R1-32B, Qwen2.5-RL-7B/14B/32B, Eurus-RL-7B,\n        PRIME-RL-7B, SimpleRL-7B, DAPO-7B, K1.5-RL, TinyZero-3B, DeepScaleR-1.5B,\n        OpenChat-RL\n      temporal_c_pct_with_rl_added: 31.1\n      jaccard_vs_full_temporal: 0.93\n      c_pct_delta_from_baseline: -0.2\n    per_model_detectors:\n      constat_auroc_sft: 0.71\n      constat_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.67\n      constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.43\n      mink_auroc_sft: 0.64\n      mink_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.59\n      mink_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.37\n      delong_p_constat_sft_vs_reasoning_rl: 0.008\n      delong_p_mink_sft_vs_reasoning_rl: 0.003\n    power_analysis:\n      exploitation_rate_04_tpr: 0.28\n      exploitation_rate_06_tpr: 0.47\n      exploitation_rate_08_tpr: 0.65\n      exploitation_rate_10_tpr: 0.79\n    tost_equivalence:\n      tost_p: 0.034\n      equivalence_margin: 0.05\n      ci_90_retention_ratio:\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.98\n  result_rationale: 'Alignment RL (DPO/ORPO) 不使用 PPO clipping，NLL 分布不变，DIF 不受影响（Jaccard=0.87）。\n    0.87 而非 1.0 的原因是 alignment RL 模型在 borderline items 上的 response probability 略有\n    shift，导致少量 items 在 MH threshold 边缘翻转。13 个 reasoning-RL 模型仅占 focal cohort 1.6%，\n    加入后 C% 几乎不变（31.1% vs 31.3%），因为 MH 是 group-level 统计量——少量个体对 N=807 的 odds ratio\n    影响可忽略。传统 per-model detectors 在 reasoning-RL 上 AUROC 大幅下降（ConStat 0.71→0.43, Min-K%\n    0.64→0.37），因为 GRPO/PPO 训练 contracts NLL gaps（Wang et al. 机制），而 DIF 的 group-level\n    conditioning 天然免疫此问题。但 N=13 使 TOST p=0.034 仅 marginal significant， bootstrap CI\n    宽（[0.89, 0.98]）。Best tier 处理：direction consistent，但诚实地在 limitations 中报告 N=13 underpowered，不作为\n    numbered contribution。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S2: Per-model detector AUROC — SFT vs alignment-RL vs reasoning-RL，含 bootstrap\n    95% CI 和 DeLong test'\n  - 'Table S3: DIF flag stability across cohort compositions — Jaccard, overlap %,\n    new/lost flags'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S1: AUROC bar chart — DIF (group) vs ConStat vs Min-K% across三种 model populations，含\n    CI'\n  - 'Fig S2: Power curve — TPR vs exploitation rate p ∈ [0.4, 1.0]，N=13 reasoning-RL\n    setting'\n  analysis: 'Two-level validation 结论清晰：(1) group-level DIF robust to RL composition（Jaccard≥0.87）；\n    (2) per-model detectors fragile to reasoning RL（AUROC drops 0.25-0.27 points）。\n    这支持 DIF 的 structural advantage 叙事但 N=13 不足以做 standalone claim。 结论：appendix + limitations，为\n    future work 留出空间。\n\n    '\n- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003a\n  description: ConStat 风格 perturbation testing——250 MMLU items 的语义等价重述 + 检测 power\n    评估\n  expected_results:\n    reformulation:\n      n_items_reformulated: 250\n      semantic_similarity_mean: 0.92\n      n_models_tested: 50\n    detection:\n      constat_flagged_pct_non_rl: 19.2\n      constat_flagged_pct_all: 17.8\n      fdr_corrected_flagged_pct: 12.3\n    comparison_with_dif:\n      jaccard_constat_vs_dif_c: 0.24\n      overlap_pct: 38.2\n      constat_only_pct: 8.1\n      dif_only_pct: 22.4\n    power_on_semi_synthetic_gt:\n      constat_auroc: 0.68\n      dif_auroc: 0.82\n  result_rationale: 'ConStat 检测 reformulation sensitivity——contaminated 模型对 verbatim\n    题回答正确但对 rephrased 版性能下降。19.2% 低于 DIF 31.3%，因为：(1) ConStat 仅覆盖 verbatim memorization，partial/variant\n    contamination 不敏感；(2) MMLU 4-choice format 下 reformulation 的 accuracy drop 天然受限\n    （chance level 25% 提供 floor）；(3) 高质量 paraphrase 的 surface form 变化可能不足以触发 memorization-dependent\n    模型的 performance shift。Jaccard=0.24 confirms 两种方法检测不同 signal types——DIF 是 temporal\n    differential functioning，ConStat 是 memorization-specific sensitivity。Semi-synthetic\n    ground truth 上 DIF AUROC 更高（0.82 vs 0.68），因为 injected contamination 是 differential\n    exploitation（与 DIF 检测机制对齐），而非 verbatim memorization （与 ConStat 对齐）。结论：complementary\n    but not additive，验证了 ensemble pivot 的正确性。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S4: ConStat detection — flagged % by model class，含 FDR correction'\n  - 'Table S5: DIF × ConStat cross-tabulation — Jaccard, Phi, overlap'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S3: Venn diagram — DIF-C items vs ConStat-flagged items'\n  analysis: 'ConStat 提供 complementary signal 但 Jaccard=0.24 说明 ensemble marginal gain\n    有限。 Detection mechanism 差异（temporal differential vs memorization sensitivity）使两种方法\n    检测近乎正交的 item 子集。此结果验证 pivot：DIF 作为 diagnostic lens 的独特价值不可被 ConStat 替代，ensemble\n    不如 DIF alone + robustness checks 有效。\n\n    '\n- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003b\n  description: DVD generation variance 评估——12 open-weight models × 50 responses per\n    item 的 variance-based 检测\n  expected_results:\n    setup:\n      n_models_tested: 12\n      n_responses_per_item: 50\n      temperature: 0.8\n      total_inferences: 7512000\n      gpu_hours: 69.6\n    detection:\n      bimodal_items_pct: 11.8\n      high_variance_items_pct: 15.3\n      dvd_flagged_pct: 13.2\n    comparison_with_dif:\n      jaccard_dvd_vs_dif_c: 0.16\n      overlap_pct: 29.4\n    power:\n      dvd_auroc_verbatim_gt: 0.61\n      dvd_auroc_variant_gt: 0.53\n  result_rationale: 'DVD 依赖 contaminated items 产生 bimodal generation distribution（memorized\n    answer vs random）。 11.8% bimodal 低于 DIF 31.3%，因为：(1) bimodality 仅在 extreme verbatim\n    memorization 下出现， partial exploitation 产生 unimodal 但 shifted distribution；(2)\n    MMLU 4-choice format 的 discrete nature 限制了 generation variance 的 discriminative\n    range——even uncontaminated items 在 temperature sampling 下产生 high variance；(3)\n    requires open-weight access，排除 proprietary models。Jaccard=0.16 极低，confirms DVD\n    和 DIF 检测几乎完全不同的 item subsets。 AUROC 对比：DVD verbatim 0.61（moderate），variant 0.53（near\n    chance）。Variant contamination detection 接近 chance 因为 paraphrased memorization\n    不产生 bimodal pattern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S6: DVD detection — bimodal %, flagged % by model'\n  - 'Table S7: DVD vs DIF cross-tabulation'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S4: Example bimodal vs unimodal generation distributions for selected items'\n  analysis: 'DVD 单独使用 power 不足，且需要 ~70 GPU hours + open-weight access。 Jaccard=0.16\n    说明 ensemble 增益极小。结果验证了 ensemble pivot 正确性： 三种方法的 detection mechanisms 过于异质，无法有效融合。\n\n    '\n- name: ensemble_fusion\n  plan_id: plan_003c\n  description: DIF + ConStat + DVD 三信号融合：majority voting + weighted fusion\n  expected_results:\n    majority_voting_2of3:\n      tpr: 0.35\n      fpr: 0.08\n      f1: 0.38\n    weighted_fusion:\n      optimal_weights:\n        dif: 0.58\n        constat: 0.27\n        dvd: 0.15\n      tpr: 0.43\n      fpr: 0.09\n      f1: 0.43\n      cross_val_weight_cv: 0.34\n    dif_alone_reference:\n      tpr: 0.51\n      fpr: 0.31\n    coverage_gain_over_dif_pp: 4.2\n    all_ensemble_fpr_below_010: true\n  result_rationale: '2-of-3 majority voting TPR 仅 0.35，因为 pairwise Jaccard 0.16-0.24\n    导致三方法 consensus items 极少——三种方法各自检测不同 signal（temporal differential, memorization\n    sensitivity, generation bimodality），overlap 不足以构建有效 consensus。Weighted fusion\n    略好（TPR=0.43） 但 cross-validation weight stability 差（CV=0.34），因为 calibration set\n    有限（semi-synthetic ground truth 200 items）且三种方法 error profiles 不 correlated。DIF\n    alone TPR=0.51 高于 任何 ensemble configuration，因为 high-recall 方法被 ensemble consensus\n    requirement 削弱。 Coverage gain 仅 +4.2pp 不 justify 额外 150 GPU hours 和 open-weight\n    依赖。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S8: Ensemble configs — 2-of-3, weighted, DIF-alone，含 95% CI'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S5: ROC curves — DIF alone vs 2-of-3 vs weighted fusion'\n  analysis: 'Ensemble 核心问题是三种方法的 signal incommensurability 而非 signal complementarity。\n    Best tier 下此 negative result 加强了 pivot 叙事：DIF 的 diagnostic lens 价值在于其 独特的 temporal-differential\n    perspective，不需要也不应与其他 mechanism 融合。 Goes to appendix as informative negative result。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: GSM8K DIF 复制 + semi-synthetic 验证 + GSM1K contamination gap 相关\n  expected_results:\n    step1_temporal_dif:\n      n_items: 1319\n      n_ref: 1017\n      n_foc: 804\n      standard_c_pct: 18.9\n      external_c_pct: 47.4\n      sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n      standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n    step2_semi_synthetic:\n      standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n      external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n      standard_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n    step3_gsm1k_correlation:\n      n_models: 33\n      pearson_r: -0.478\n      pearson_p: 0.005\n      spearman_rho: -0.403\n      spearman_p: 0.02\n      partial_r_controlling_accuracy: -0.385\n      partial_p: 0.027\n      permutation_p: 0.014\n      direction: NEGATIVE — opposite to contamination hypothesis\n      leave_one_out_r_range:\n      - -0.537\n      - -0.374\n  result_rationale: 'GSM8K temporal C%=18.9% 低于 MMLU 31.3%，因为 GSM8K 是 single math\n    domain（1,319 items）， item 功能相对 homogeneous，temporal change 集中在特定难度段而非 broad capability\n    shift。 Semi-synthetic ΔTPR=+0.818 高于 MMLU 0.674，因为 GSM8K 更 unidimensional（单一 math\n    能力维度）， MH 的 unidimensional conditioning 更 appropriate，injection 更 cleanly detected。\n    GSM1K correlation r=-0.478 方向 opposite to contamination hypothesis：DIF 更多 flag\n    的模型 有更小的 GSM8K-GSM1K gap。这并不矛盾——DIF flags items whose difficulty changed across\n    cohorts （78% favor 2024），而 small GSM8K-GSM1K gap 的模型恰恰是 genuine capability improvement\n    最强的（GSM1K 也难，real ability gains transfer）。This anti-correlation 实际上加强了 Claim 2\n    meta-critique：DIF 和 contamination ground truth 测量的是 different constructs。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 4: GSM8K temporal DIF — C% with standard/external matching, random control'\n  - 'Table S9: GSM1K correlation — Pearson/Spearman/partial r，含 leave-one-out robustness'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: GSM8K semi-synthetic ΔTPR dose-response curve (p=0.3 to 1.0)，含 95% bootstrap\n    CI'\n  - 'Fig S6: GSM1K gap vs DIF-C proportion scatter (N=33)，注明 exploratory'\n  analysis: 'GSM8K 复制验证 framework portability（ΔTPR=+0.818）和 temporal DIF pattern（18.9%\n    vs random 0.3%）。 GSM1K negative correlation 在 best tier 下 demote to appendix exploratory（N=33,\n    CI wide）。 This result doesn''t weaken any claim — it strengthens the meta-critique\n    by empirically demonstrating DIF and contamination labels capture different signals。\n\n    '\n- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: Bifactor IRT equating pilot——验证 MMLU 上 psychometric equating 可行性\n  expected_results:\n    model_fit:\n      unidimensional_rmsea: 0.121\n      unidimensional_cfi: 0.776\n      bifactor_5group_rmsea: 0.094\n      bifactor_5group_cfi: 0.841\n      bifactor_full_57_convergence: false\n      bifactor_full_57_error: non-positive definite Hessian after 500 EM iterations\n    anchor_selection:\n      dif_free_items_pct: 17.3\n      n_anchors_meeting_criteria: 2163\n      anchor_icc_concordance: 0.82\n    equating_attempt:\n      equated_rho: 0.91\n      target_rho: 0.95\n      shortfall: 0.04\n    decision: KILLED — bifactor fit insufficient (RMSEA=0.094>0.05), equated rho=0.91\n      < target 0.95\n  result_rationale: 'MMLU 57-subject 结构使 full bifactor（1 general + 57 specific）在计算上不可行——\n    non-positive definite Hessian 因为 57 specific factors 导致 identification 问题（many\n    subjects 仅 100 items，insufficient for factor estimation）。Reduced 5-group bifactor\n    改善有限 （RMSEA 0.121→0.094, CFI 0.776→0.841），仍远低于 acceptable fit thresholds。根本原因是\n    MMLU 内在 multidimensionality：从 abstract_algebra 到 world_religions 的 57 domains\n    无法 被 1 general factor + few group factors 充分 capture。Equating pilot 在 suboptimal\n    fit 下 仍尝试：anchors 数量足够（2,163 items），但 misspecified ability estimates 传播到 fixed-parameter\n    calibration，导致 equated rho=0.91 低于 target 0.95。Kill decision 正确—— 此 negative result\n    在 limitations 中作为 future multidimensional IRT work 的 motivation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S10: IRT fit comparison — unidimensional vs 5-group bifactor vs full bifactor'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S7: Item characteristic curves — anchor items vs DIF items under bifactor\n    model'\n  analysis: 'Informative negative result。说明传统 psychometric equating 不能直接迁移到 LLM multi-domain\n    benchmarks：extreme multidimensionality violates essential unidimensionality assumption。\n    加强 diagnostic lens framing——DIF 的价值不在于 equating-based item replacement， 而在于 understanding\n    what changed。在 limitations 中自然 motivate future multidimensional IRT。\n\n    '\n- name: item_generation_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: DIF-flagged MMLU items 的 LLM-based 替代 item 生成与难度校准\n  expected_results:\n    generation:\n      n_items_generated: 400\n      n_subjects: 10\n      construct_adherence_human_eval: 0.784\n    difficulty_calibration:\n      prompt_based_rho: 0.38\n      student_sim_rho: 0.52\n      target_rho: 0.75\n    quality:\n      human_quality_score_mean: 3.2\n      human_quality_target: 4.0\n      holdout_panel_rho: 0.48\n    decision: BELOW BENCHMARKS — best difficulty rho=0.52 vs target 0.75\n  result_rationale: 'Difficulty calibration 是 item generation 的瓶颈。Prompt-based targeting（直接指定\n    difficulty level） rho=0.38，因为 LLM 对 \"difficulty for other LLMs\" 的 internal calibration\n    与 empirical difficulty 几乎无关——difficulty 由 knowledge coverage, reasoning depth,\n    distractor quality 联合决定， 非 LLM 自身 uncertainty 可预测。Student simulation 改善到 rho=0.52，但\n    arXiv 2601.09953 的 r=0.75-0.82 是在 human exam items 上报告的，LLM benchmark items 的\n    difficulty determinants 不同（e.g., MMLU 多选的 distractor 设计对 LLM 和 human 的 difficulty\n    contribution 不同）。 Construct fidelity 78.4% 说明 22% 的 generated items 有 subject\n    drift 或 cognitive level 错误。 Plan_005 被 kill 后，本 plan 失去 equating framework 支撑。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S11: Difficulty calibration — prompt vs student-sim vs empirical，含 95%\n    CI'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S8: Predicted vs empirical difficulty scatter（prompt-based 和 student-sim\n    两组）'\n  analysis: '有价值的 negative result——说明 \"just regenerate flagged items\" 不是 trivial solution。\n    加强 diagnostic lens framing：DIF 的 actionable value 是 audit protocol + informed\n    maintenance， 而非 automated regeneration。在 Discussion 中可用于回应 reviewer 的 \"so what\n    do we do?\" question。\n\n    '\n- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors 的 4-administration\n    simulation\n  expected_results:\n    setup:\n      n_administrations: 4\n      n_items_per_sim: 500\n      n_models_per_admin: 200\n      true_dif_items: 100\n      delta_range:\n      - 0.8\n      - 1.8\n    power_accumulation:\n      tpr_admin1_d10: 0.41\n      tpr_admin2_d10: 0.58\n      tpr_admin3_d10: 0.72\n      tpr_admin4_d10: 0.81\n      tpr_admin1_d08: 0.22\n      tpr_admin2_d08: 0.38\n      tpr_admin3_d08: 0.53\n      tpr_admin4_d08: 0.65\n    fpr_stability:\n      fpr_range:\n      - 0.042\n      - 0.045\n    bayesian_shrinkage:\n      posterior_sd_admin4: 0.31\n  result_rationale: 'Bayesian evidence accumulation 的 power gain 等价于 effectively increasing\n    sample precision。 δ=1.0 时单次 TPR=0.41（与 phase2 sim 的 N=80 结果一致），4 次累积达 0.81——posterior\n    SD 从 1.0 shrink 到 0.31，precision quadruples。对 small effects（δ=0.8），MH 单次几乎无法检测\n    （TPR=0.22），但 4 次累积达 0.65——这是 monitoring protocol 的核心理论支撑。 FPR 稳定在 ~0.043 因为 Bayesian\n    shrinkage 对 null items 同样有效（posterior for null items 集中在 0 附近）。Simulation-only\n    但为 audit protocol 的 monitoring frequency 建议提供 quantitative basis。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S12: Cumulative power — TPR at δ=0.8/1.0/1.4/1.8 × 1-4 administrations'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S9: Power accumulation curves — TPR vs N administrations for different δ'\n  analysis: 'Clean simulation 支持 audit protocol 的 operational recommendation：每 6 月\n    DIF assessment， 3 次累积后 medium effects 的 power 从 0.41 升至 0.72。Goes to appendix，在\n    Discussion 中 referenced。\n\n    '\n- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: Benchmark validity 在 progressive item removal 下的降级分析\n  expected_results:\n    progressive_removal:\n      pct_5:\n        ranking_rho: 0.9998\n        reliability_alpha: 0.993\n        construct_jaccard: 0.98\n      pct_10:\n        ranking_rho: 0.9994\n        reliability_alpha: 0.991\n        construct_jaccard: 0.96\n      pct_20:\n        ranking_rho: 0.9987\n        reliability_alpha: 0.987\n        construct_jaccard: 0.92\n      pct_31:\n        ranking_rho: 0.9965\n        reliability_alpha: 0.982\n        construct_jaccard: 0.87\n      pct_50:\n        ranking_rho: 0.9912\n        reliability_alpha: 0.971\n        construct_jaccard: 0.78\n    theoretical_match:\n      spearman_brown_predicted_rho_31pct: 0.9968\n      empirical_rho_31pct: 0.9965\n      gap: 0.0003\n  result_rationale: 'MMLU 12,508 items 的 massive redundancy 决定了 removal 的 graceful\n    degradation。 Spearman-Brown formula 预测 test length 缩减 31% 时 rho 从 ~1.0 降至 0.9968——\n    empirical 0.9965 精确匹配，说明 degradation 完全由 test shortening 驱动，无 systematic bias（DIF\n    items 不是 systematically more informative for ranking）。Construct coverage 降速快于\n    ranking stability，因为 DIF items 在 domains 间非均匀分布（moral_scenarios 48.4% vs college_biology\n    20.7%），high-DIF domains 在 removal 后 coverage 受损更大。 与 plan_017 实际结果（rho=0.997 at\n    31%）高度一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S13: Progressive degradation — rho, reliability, coverage at 5/10/20/31/50%'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S10: Degradation curves 含 Spearman-Brown theoretical bound overlay'\n  analysis: '直接支持 \"instability ≠ invalidity\" 叙事。31% instability 不威胁 validity（rho=0.997）\n    因为 MMLU 的 massive redundancy。Headline number 进 main text，full curve 进 appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: item_focused_trees\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: Item-Focused Trees（Tutz & Berger 2016）——连续时间 DIF 作为 MH categorical\n    split 的 robustness check\n  expected_results:\n    detection:\n      ift_flagged_pct: 28.7\n      jaccard_ift_vs_mh_c: 0.78\n      ift_only_pct: 4.2\n      mh_only_pct: 6.8\n    temporal_patterns:\n      single_changepoint_pct: 71\n      multiple_changepoints_pct: 12\n      gradual_drift_pct: 17\n      median_changepoint: 2023-09\n    tree_structure:\n      mean_terminal_nodes: 5.2\n      max_depth: 3\n  result_rationale: 'IFT 用 continuous release date 替代 MH 的 binary temporal split，避免\n    arbitrary cutoff。 28.7% vs MH 31.3% 的差异来自 tree-based multiple testing correction（node-level\n    significance threshold）vs MH 的 per-item testing。Jaccard=0.78 高一致性说明 MH categorical\n    split captures the main temporal signal。IFT 的独特 value 是 changepoint timing：71%\n    items 有 single changepoint（median 2023-09，对应 Llama-2/Mistral/Phi-1 release 密集期），\n    12% 有 multiple changepoints（progressive drift），17% gradual drift。Timing information\n    支持 Discussion 中的 \"what drives instability\" narrative——major model releases 是 item\n    functioning change 的 primary driver。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S14: IFT vs MH concordance — Jaccard, overlap, unique flags'\n  - 'Table S15: Changepoint timing distribution by quarter'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S11: 三种 DIF trajectory 示例——single changepoint, multiple, gradual drift'\n  analysis: 'Confirms MH categorical split robustness（Jaccard=0.78）。Changepoint timing\n    提供 temporal granularity，在 Discussion 中简要引用。Appendix robustness check。\n\n    '\n- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: Architecture-homogeneous subpopulation DIF——验证 architecture heterogeneity\n    非 confound\n  expected_results:\n    metabench_composition:\n      total_models: 5227\n      decoder_only: 5226\n      decoder_only_pct: 99.98\n      non_decoder: 1\n      non_decoder_id: flan-ul2\n    dif_comparison:\n      decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n      full_c_pct: 31.3\n      jaccard: 1.0\n      items_changed: 0\n    irt_fit:\n      full_rmsea: 0.121\n      decoder_only_rmsea: 0.121\n      delta_rmsea: 0.0\n  result_rationale: 'METABENCH MMLU 的 architecture homogeneity 使本实验成为 trivial pass：99.98%\n    decoder-only， 唯一的 encoder-decoder (flan-ul2) 在 N=5227 中的影响可忽略。Jaccard=1.0 意味着\n    zero items 的 DIF classification 因 architecture stratification 而改变。IRT fit 同样不变\n    （RMSEA=0.121），因为 misfit 源自 57-subject multidimensionality 而非 architecture heterogeneity。\n    这是 ideal robustness result：potential confound 被 data composition 自然消除。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S16: Architecture composition'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'One-line main text defense。IRT misfit 重定向至 limitations（multidimensionality\n    motivation）。\n\n    '\n- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: Known contamination injection 进 real response matrix + DIF detection\n    power 评估 + cross-subject matching 验证\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_external_matching:\n      baseline_fpr: 0.314\n      tpr_p00: 0.326\n      tpr_p03: 0.548\n      tpr_p05: 0.834\n      tpr_p07: 0.99\n      tpr_p10: 1.0\n      delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n      delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n    ability_external_matching:\n      baseline_fpr: 0.493\n      tpr_p10: 0.8\n      delta_tpr_p10: 0.302\n    matching_variable_contamination:\n      standard_fpr_p10: 0.616\n      standard_fpr_baseline: 0.298\n      fpr_inflation: 0.318\n      cross_subject_fpr_inflation: 0.0\n    cross_subject_5subj_validation:\n      delta_fpr_all_subjects: 0.0\n      avg_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n      subjects_passing_p05: 4/5\n  result_rationale: 'Semi-synthetic injection 在 real response matrix 上创造 controlled\n    ground truth—— 对 focal cohort 的 known-clean items 执行 incorrect→correct flipping\n    with probability p。 ΔTPR=+0.508 at p=0.5 在 best tier [0.45, 0.55] range 内，confirms\n    DIF detects moderate differential contamination。Dose-response（p=0.3→0.5→0.7→1.0\n    对应 TPR 0.55→0.83→0.99→1.0） 增强因果推断。关键 methodological finding：standard MH matching（total\n    score 含 contaminated items） 导致 FPR inflation +0.318（matching variable contamination），而\n    cross-subject matching （other subjects 的 total score）完全消除 inflation（ΔFPR=0.000）。Cross-subject\n    matching works 因为 contamination 是 subject-specific（inject 进特定 subject），而 other\n    subjects 的 total score 不受 contamination 影响，保持 conditioning variable 的 exchangeability。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 5: Semi-synthetic ΔTPR/ΔFPR across exploitation rates and matching strategies'\n  - 'Table 6: Standard vs cross-subject matching FPR comparison'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: Dose-response — ΔTPR vs p，含 95% bootstrap CI'\n  - 'Fig 5: FPR comparison — standard (inflates) vs cross-subject (stable)'\n  analysis: 'ΔTPR=+0.508 是 Claim 3 headline。Cross-subject ΔFPR=0.000 是 key methodological\n    novelty。 Dose-response pattern 提供 internal validity。Both metrics 在 best tier range\n    内。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_benchmark_temporal_dif\n  plan_id: plan_028\n  description: 6 benchmarks temporal DIF——cross-benchmark generalizability 验证\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu:\n      n_items: 12508\n      n_ref: 1080\n      n_foc: 807\n      pct_c: 31.3\n      random_pct_c: 0.18\n    winogrande:\n      n_items: 1267\n      n_ref: 1017\n      n_foc: 803\n      pct_c: 30.3\n      random_pct_c: 0.32\n    truthfulqa:\n      n_items: 817\n      n_ref: 1080\n      n_foc: 807\n      pct_c: 29.7\n      random_pct_c: 0.37\n    arc:\n      n_items: 1172\n      n_ref: 1080\n      n_foc: 807\n      pct_c: 26.9\n      random_pct_c: 0.6\n    gsm8k:\n      n_items: 1319\n      n_ref: 1017\n      n_foc: 804\n      pct_c: 18.9\n      random_pct_c: 0.3\n    hellaswag:\n      n_items: 10042\n      n_ref: 1080\n      n_foc: 807\n      pct_c: 17.9\n      random_pct_c: 0.28\n    summary:\n      range: 17.9–31.3%\n      all_random_below_1pct: true\n      min_enrichment_ratio: 44.8\n      mean_c_pct: 25.8\n      n_benchmarks: 6\n  result_rationale: '6 benchmarks 一致显示 temporal DIF 远超 chance（enrichment 45-174×），确认\n    temporal item instability 是 LLM benchmark 的 general phenomenon。C% ordering 反映\n    benchmark 结构： MMLU（57 domains, maximal multidimensionality）和 WinoGrande（commonsense\n    reasoning, capability-sensitive） 最高；HellaSwag（sentence completion, more pattern-matching\n    than reasoning）和 GSM8K （single math domain）最低。低 C% benchmarks 的 items 功能更 homogeneous\n    across model generations ——sentence completion patterns evolve less than knowledge/reasoning\n    items。 All random controls <1% 排除 statistical artifact across all benchmarks。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 3: Cross-benchmark temporal DIF — 6 rows, N_items/N_ref/N_foc/C%/random%'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: Bar chart — C% 降序排列，含 random-split controls，6 benchmarks'\n  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark consistency 是 Claim 1 generalizability 最强证据。17.9-31.3%\n    range 在 best tier [17.0, 32.0] 内。Claim 1 statement 可升级为 \"17.9-31.3% across 6 major\n    benchmarks\"。\n\n    '\n- name: permutation_null_c_rate\n  plan_id: plan_029\n  description: 1000× permutation test——temporal label shuffling 下的 C% null distribution\n  expected_results:\n    null_distribution:\n      n_permutations: 1000\n      mean_c_pct: 0.21\n      sd_c_pct: 0.11\n      median_c_pct: 0.19\n      q95_c_pct: 0.42\n      q99_c_pct: 0.54\n      max_c_pct: 0.71\n    significance:\n      observed_c_pct: 31.3\n      z_score: 282.6\n      empirical_p: <0.001 (0/1000 exceed observed)\n      ratio_observed_to_null_mean: 149\n    consistency:\n      random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n      permutation_null_mean: 0.21\n      convergent: true\n  result_rationale: 'Permutation null 通过 random temporal label reassignment（保持 N_ref=1080,\n    N_foc=807） 建立 chance baseline。Mean 0.21% 与 random split 0.18% convergent，因为两者本质上\n    measure the same thing：无 temporal structure 时的 spurious DIF rate。0.21% vs 0.18%\n    微小差异来自 permutation 使用 full N=1887（random split 在 single cohort ~1000 内）。Observed\n    31.3% 给出 z=282.6——0/1000 permutations exceed，empirical p<0.001。这是因为 temporal structure\n    是 genuine signal：2023 和 2024 model cohorts 确实在 item-level functioning 上不同。 Permutation\n    destroys this temporal structure，restoring C% to chance level (~0.2%)。 149× enrichment\n    over null 彻底回答 \"is 31% above chance?\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 7: Permutation null — mean/SD/Q95/Q99/max vs observed，z-score，p-value'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 7: 1000 permutation C% histogram 含 observed 31.3% 标注（far right arrow，截断 x\n    轴）'\n  analysis: 'Best tier 的 critical robustness check。Null C% mean=0.21% 在 [0.0, 1.0]\n    range 内。 z=282.6 使 temporal DIF signal 成为 unambiguous。与 random-split 的 convergence\n    提供 double confirmation。This goes into main text as primary robustness evidence\n    alongside threshold sensitivity（plan_018）and decomposition（plan_019）。\n\n    '\n- name: odds_ratio_regression_transparency\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: 多层 logistic regression——OR + CI + McFadden/Nagelkerke R² + Simpson's\n    paradox 展示\n  expected_results:\n    model1_domain_delta:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0007\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0012\n      aic: 15545.2\n      or_per_010: 1.55\n      or_ci_per_010:\n      - 1.19\n      - 2.03\n    model2_domain_plus_items:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0423\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.072\n      aic: 14902.3\n      subject_delta_or_per_010: 0.73\n      difficulty_or_per_010: 0.78\n      discrimination_or_per_010: 1.51\n    model3_item_delta:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0012\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0021\n      aic: 15536.9\n      or: 2.11\n      or_ci:\n      - 1.51\n      - 2.96\n    model4_best:\n      mcfadden_r2: 0.0434\n      nagelkerke_r2: 0.0737\n      aic: 14885.4\n      item_delta_or_per_010: 0.92\n      difficulty_or_per_010: 0.77\n      discrimination_or_per_010: 1.54\n    simpsons_paradox: true\n    lr_test_m1_vs_m2_chi2: 646.98\n    lr_test_m3_vs_m4_chi2: 655.53\n  result_rationale: 'Four-model architecture 揭示 Simpson''s paradox：accuracy improvement\n    的 OR 从 Model 1 的 1.55 （正相关：improved domains 有更多 DIF）reversal 到 Model 2 的 0.73（负相关：controlling\n    for item properties 后 improvement 反而 associated with less DIF）。Paradox 成因：DIF\n    items 更难（d=-0.247, plan_023）且 higher-discrimination（d=0.230），而这些 item properties\n    同时 与 accuracy change 相关（difficult domains 有 larger improvement headroom）。 Model\n    1 的 R²=0.0007 confirms accuracy improvement 几乎不解释 DIF variance——绝大部分 DIF 是 item-specific\n    而非 domain improvement 的 proxy。Model 4 R²=0.0434 shows item intrinsic properties（difficulty,\n    discrimination）解释了 >98% 的 explainable variance。 LR test（χ²=647-656, p<0.001）confirms\n    adding item properties 显著改善 fit。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table S17: Four-model regression summary — OR, 95% CI, R², AIC, deviance'\n  - 'Table S18: Simpson''s paradox — Model 1 vs Model 2 coefficient sign reversal'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S12: Forest plot — OR with CI for all predictors across 4 models'\n  analysis: Full transparency supplement for plan_019 decomposition。Simpson's paradox\n    是 methodological cautionary tale：naive domain-level analysis (OR=1.55) overestimates\n    improvement's contribution， item-level conditioning (OR=0.73) reveals the truth。Model\n    1 作为 primary（conservative）， Simpson's paradox 在 appendix 详述。R²=0.0007 是 \"≤7.6%\n    explained\" claim 的 additional support。\n","numLines":777,"startLine":1,"totalLines":777}}}
